[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12483.07, "timestamp": "03:28:03", "text": "これはなかなか良いスキル問題ですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12489.51, "timestamp": "03:28:09", "text": "アドベンチャーモードとは何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12492.71, "timestamp": "03:28:12", "text": "ええと、通り抜けることはできますが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12501.19, "timestamp": "03:28:21", "text": "ああ、兄弟、もし私が今また神になったら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12502.11, "timestamp": "03:28:22", "text": "殺す"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12509.19, "timestamp": "03:28:29", "text": "片手で簡単に殺せるんだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12511.67, "timestamp": "03:28:31", "text": "それ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12514.91, "timestamp": "03:28:34", "text": "わかったよ、ジョー、何か見せてあげるよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12524.51, "timestamp": "03:28:44", "text": "スクリーンインスタント"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12528.87, "timestamp": "03:28:48", "text": "外。それは何ですか？どうやって？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12531.91, "timestamp": "03:28:51", "text": "それは私のパワーアップアイテムの一つでした。見る？来る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12534.07, "timestamp": "03:28:54", "text": "「殺さないで」に戻る。来る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12538.269, "timestamp": "03:28:58", "text": "通常の生存に戻る。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12539.45, "timestamp": "03:28:59", "text": "わかった。"}]